Cities and Knights mode has several significant ways in which it changes the board.

When this mode is active, cities no longer have the property of producing two of a resource. Instead they generate one resource of that type, and one commodity. This is determined as:

- Lumber -> Paper
- Wool -> Cloth
- Ore -> Coin

The table of statistics should have rows at the bottom for each of these commodities.

The radial view has a toggle at the side for "Commodities". This should be small. If switched on, the 5-way radial becomes an 8-way radial including commodity production. These extra directions should appear and smoothly and quickly expand, or do the reverse when changing back.

The bars showing the reliance on each number include contributions from commodities.
